{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_09_end",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_09",
  "title": "得果",
  "storyCode": "HS-9",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "39a800d742cb7bf6b59bf9a9137b196dcf4b5eb8ac638a9f2c0a24e06115d881",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "谁料到会有这样的一场雪？\n田垄上厚厚地覆盖着一层令人绝望的白，星星点点的黄色，是月前刚刚种下的麦子艰难地探出的头。\n一旬后还能活下几株？叫人不敢想。\n一只鼷兽东奔西走，跌跌撞撞来到这片寂静的麦田。\n眼前稀稀拉拉的庄稼对它来说算是意外之喜，它小心地嗅闻着，盘算着多少够填饱一半自己的肚子，还有多少够带回洞穴里喂养同族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "直到一柄粗铁锄头落在它的脊柱上。\n又少了三株麦子。\n气愤的农夫抓住了那只糟蹋庄稼的畜生，恨不得将其扒皮啖肉，可瘦得只剩骨头的尸体拎在手里也没有几两重。\n农夫悠长地叹了口气，把鼷兽的尸体埋进了地里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "多可怜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "风雨无常，总有这样的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "如果这些麦子死于这场雪，来年有多少人会死于荒灾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "但也会有很多人帮助他们，会有很多人幸存下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "生命本身不会断绝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天穹如幕。\n飘渺的绸缎似有千钧之重，牢牢地隔开了二人的攻击，向二人压去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "年，收手吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "帮你造好这个心脏也算费了不少力气，再打下去，把它拆了，前功尽弃多不划算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你也不见得有功夫说闲话吧，刚才那个炮仗明明差一点就炸到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "怎么不见你在我的画里到处搞破坏的力气呢？你就不能铸把大号剪刀把他的那几匹布剪碎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你倒是出点力气啊！你的画都要被他变成刺绣了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你还说我——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "有点难啊，刚造好一个大号的炮仗就被他拆成线了，原来他一直能做到这种事的么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我还以为这些年他不会有心思用在钻研能力上呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "可是为什么，他好像对我们的能力都这么熟悉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "慢着，他那边，真的只有一个人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "时间差不多了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "难得的聚会，本来确实想再多聊聊，可时间实在是有点紧张，还是容我先告辞了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "实在不想动这个手的，下次有机会再见的话，再给你们赔礼道歉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "如果还有机会的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "对妹妹也下得去手，太不像话了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "黍姐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "虽然猜到你不至于就这样消失......你真的没事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你最好不是在故意吓唬我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "就当久违地做了一个长点的梦吧。抱歉，让你们担心啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "还是要来看看我这个弟弟，难得回来一次就闹这么一场，是真的不把这里当家了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "......姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你每次做错了事，脸上都会是这个表情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "有多久了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "......整六十七年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "那今天必须要留下来吃顿饭了，有什么话都可以饭桌上慢慢聊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "对不起姐姐。这一次，我不能听话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "是听了另一位的话吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "一直躲起来的那位，还打算躲到什么时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "有什么话，直接对我来说不好吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一人自远处缓缓走来，走过了亘古的时间。又仿佛他从一开始就在这里。\n时间与空间随着他的足音静止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你总算愿意现身了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "这么多人......真是热闹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你们，还有心思在这里胡闹？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "他不是，已经疯了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "这家庭派对的气氛，和我想象的实在不太一样啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "电影里面，看到通缉令上的家属突然出现在家里应该怎么办来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "这到底是他自己，还是只是一个影子？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "臭棋篓子现在再做什么事我都不会奇怪了，要是再在这里搞出一只岁相可真不是闹着玩的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "怎么办，黍姐，真的要动手吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "尚蜀，玉门，还有这里......你不觉得自己做得太过火了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "舍小取大，各取所需，如此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "看看外面受灾的田地，受苦的百姓......我可没办法听过这句话就算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "细算下来，这笔账归咎于谁还要两说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "那你就留下来，给我好好算清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "这笔账，从千年前就开始算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你很久没有来这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我有我的事要做......北边有战事，行军布阵，总要身在一线的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "“白骨露于野，千里无羽鸣。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "连年征战，到头来，还是苦了这些田垄间的百姓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你很在意他们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你口中羸弱的族群，却是我们真正意义上的师长。我们是模仿他们的样子，找到了自己感兴趣的那件事，才找到了自己在世间的位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我们与他们，到底不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "又有多少不同呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "巨兽万年寿命，蜉蝣朝生暮死，究其根本都是生在这方天地间的生命。是生命，都终有竟时。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "战争杀伐，你为什么偏偏挑中了这样的差事？你到底从中看到了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "规则与秩序。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我最近学会了一种游戏，“围棋”。规则简单，原理竟与兵法相通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "这更让我明白了一个道理，纷纷世事，看似混沌无序，但只要掌握了那个规则，就能计算出最终的结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我们都很关注的那个结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "这片死寂......这就是你看到的结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "不止是我们，也是这片大地上所有生灵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "多么讽刺，灭亡为“果”，难道“生命”本身才是“因”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你一直在这里守望着，从来不会觉得厌倦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "这世间万物可爱，在它此时此刻的模样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "万物有时，人、兽、山水草木皆如是。这是人们说的“道”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "春草年年绿，我们来过，存在过，还不够吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "所以你就接受了这样的结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你并不这么觉得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我只是在想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我们何曾，真正作为自己活过？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你该不会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我想了很久......算了很久......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我终于......看到了另一个结局。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不远处，积雪下，一株翠绿的禾苗探出头来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你能看到的，黍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瘦削的男人伸出手来，指尖上还留着粗粝的棋茧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "能不能替我看看，我的命数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "“孤宿无两；劫数茫茫，九死一生。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我很期待......我会等着的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "......你可曾再见过她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你明知道那是不可能的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "我时常会想起她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "她说“有教无类”，想让天底下每个人都能读书识字......那些学府、书本，都是她留下的痕迹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你们在这方面倒是很像。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "可是最近这几年，我已经忘了许多事......关于她的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "忘了她写下过哪些书卷，还有这一字真名的意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我分明记得，她曾与我对弈一局，她想要在局中告诉我什么，如今却无论如何想不起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "我本以为......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "是......即使同为“我”们，也逃不过这样的影响。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你在后悔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我想找一个解法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "一百八十一份，所有人都以为......你已经疯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "或许吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你想要怎么做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我要回到那副躯壳中去，我需要祂的力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "杀死祂，成为祂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "用祂的力量，为这普天之下万千生灵谋一份“大利”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你会没命的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "但你们会活下来。真正作为自己......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "黍，我想借你的一点力量。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我们十二人，多一个人的力量，多一分胜算。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "广袤的农田阡陌交通，来人在棋盘上落下一子。\n黍伸开手掌，一把种子落在棋盘上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "这就是你的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "这是你的因果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "如果你没有行差踏错，确实在走向那个终点，这把种子会在合适的时候发芽，结出你想要的果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "你也会给我出题了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "总不能一直让你刁难我们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "呵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "我的事情已经谈完了，还有什么事，你自己说吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "真是长大了，翅膀硬了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我都一千岁了......姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "我拦不住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "上次走的时候还大吵了一架，这一次能不能给我留样东西，当个念想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "整座大荒城都被你织到了那幅锦绣里，你还想要带走什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你要是还有什么不舍的，最好活着回来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "说的也是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "夕，能不能最后再问你要一样东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你想要什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "那幅画，可以提前给我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你怎么知——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我会好好保管的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "这账本，今天就算做平了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "谁允许你走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "是你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "岁老二！*炎国粗口*，我就知道是你个臭崽子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "一天到晚不安生，不躲在破庙里下你那破棋，撒泼耍浑闹到我的地盘上来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "你们几个人在这闹上一场，糟蹋了多少庄稼！你看我今天不揍你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "当心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "绸缎在炽白的火焰前一触即燃，在转瞬间灰飞烟灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "逆向分解源石技艺？你什么时候学会的......不对......这是“因果”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "呵......你还剩多少颗子，还能挡我几次火？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "天师......现在恐怕也不是动手的时候吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "天机阁如今损失惨重，你要是再有三长两短，大炎北边的防线可就岌岌可危了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "在炎国北境虎视眈眈的，可不止那些邪魔秽物吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "少吓唬人！我今天非要教训你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "那和你一道那几位长生者，你也不在乎了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "呵......你为了心智不受邪魔侵染才装作这一副疯疯癫癫的样子，倒没忘了自己真正该做的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "权衡利弊，我们未必没有可以合作的可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "望",
      "text": "后会有期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "结束了......吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飘忽的女性",
      "text": "嗯，都结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飘忽的女性",
      "text": "你不惜性命，也要换来这个工程，为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "......功成名就，出人头地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飘忽的女性",
      "text": "功成名就之后又如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "我有一个梦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "万里连城，可达天上宫阙；大地之广，不再有百姓无遮风挡雨之处......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "不成一番伟业，枉为天师......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飘忽的女性",
      "text": "难道非要身居高位，万人之上，才能为你梦里的城池楼宇添砖加瓦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "你......是天上的仙人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飘忽的女性",
      "text": "你的梦，我收下了，就替了你抵押出去的性命吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "（虚弱的呼吸）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "万侍郎",
      "text": "天上白玉京，十二楼五城......仙人抚我顶，结发受长生......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......\n天上白玉京，十二楼五城。\n安得广厦千万间，大庇天下寒士俱欢颜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "我这是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "别担心，那些怪物已经消失不见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "你救了我......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "谈不上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "我路过的时候见你晕倒在地里，这才喊你起来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "......多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "你是大荒城的“老乡长”，但也不是所有担子都压在你一个人身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "用自己的命去和别人换这个地方的平安，不见得是笔划算买卖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "哪能由得人选呢......大荒城，平安就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "你很在乎这个地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "大半辈子都活在这里，根早就在这儿了，哪能不在乎呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的农业天师",
      "text": "多保重，我先走啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "再见，黍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "荣晚晴",
      "text": "你该自由了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "培养器，培养器......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "这株水稻还能救活......实验还有希望......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "你在这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "我找到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "找到什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "这是试验田里......“万顷”的实验项目，活下来的那一株水稻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "源石污染的土地上不是没有可能种庄稼的，老师的实验终于能看到结果了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "您......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "您是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "看您的穿着，您也是这里天师府的授业天师吗？我好像从来没有见过您？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "是......我来到这里不久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "少年似是有些困惑地挠了挠头发，觉得自己像是忘了什么事。\n仿佛做了一个很久的梦，梦中情绪依稀还在心中萦绕，而梦中所见之人，所遇之事，却无论如何回想不起来。\n愣神了一会，少年咧开嘴笑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "我是天师府的学生，我叫禾生。我也该叫您老师了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "你好，小禾......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "我刚刚，发现了一株很关键的庄稼......可以在源石污染过的土地上生长的庄稼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "这是一项做了很久的研究，只要能推广这种作物，我们就能把许多用不了的荒地变成农田，再也不会有人饿肚子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "离这个目标可能还需要一段时间，可能是很长一段时间，但至少现在看到了一点希望......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "那你愿意，把往后的时间都投入在这件事上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "那祝你好运。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "加油吧，我就不打扰你继续做研究了，再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "欸，您这就要走了吗？我还想向您多介绍一点，或许还需要您的一些指点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "不用啦，我相信，你一定可以实现你的目标的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温柔的女性",
      "text": "再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "欸......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "禾生",
      "text": "那位老师，为什么看上去，好像在哪里见过呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的商人",
      "text": "老伯，送货去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的商人",
      "text": "今年的粮价怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "荒年，每斤粮比去年贵三文。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的商人",
      "text": "要算最后装进口袋里的钱，应该是比去年多？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "不见得是好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "种地都是为了让人填饱肚子，没听说过能靠种地发财。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的商人",
      "text": "教您一个多赚钱的法子，卖粮的时候，可以留个心眼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "精明的商人",
      "text": "种出来的作物，成色最好的，标平价就近卖，赚口碑；成色普通的，标高价，雇商队卖去远点的地方，卖新奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "什么乱七八糟的，从来没听说过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "最好的作物当然是先留给家人朋友，成色普通的拿去卖，再差一些的只能拉去当饲料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年迈的职农",
      "text": "你这年轻人，花花肠子太多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "准备去哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "百灶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "闹上这么一出，就这样一声不吭地走了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "是该走了。但我又没有大哥那样的能耐，您老人家要是不愿意放我离开，我当然是走不掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "就看您，是真不愿意让我走吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "我只想问你一个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "你说要和炎国做的一笔交易，是从一开始就打算帮炎国造好这座大荒城？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我是个生意人，做生意，讲究互利互惠。要是只有一方得利，那岂不是和强盗没有区别？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "既然你们不是要与整个炎国为敌，那又何必要做这种事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "你们兄弟两个，就一定要和炎国走到打起来的地步？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我们的那位姐妹，到底是被害死的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "且不说炎国百姓与我们无冤无仇，就算二哥他将这天下当作棋盘，可棋手对用久了的棋具也未尝没有感情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "但是，端坐庙堂之上，阴影之中的那几位，必须要为自己做的事付出代价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "这笔账，总得算算清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "哪怕搭上的是自己的命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "以十二分之一的分身，去对抗那一整个整体，本就九死一生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我的命，也在账本上标好了价。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "真是疯了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我还记得，在很久之前，您就挨个来找过我们兄弟姐妹，问过每个人一个问题，又给我们各自指了路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "“你在这片炎国大地上看到了什么？”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我的答案从来没有变过，想来二哥他也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "*炎国粗口*，从一开始我就不喜欢你和那个老二，我讲道理讲不过你们，到时候还是要揍你们的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "我那个哥哥，从前就是这个脾气，输了棋就摔杯砸碗的。不过身体弱些，也摔不重就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "这次做过了火，有劳天师多担待了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“老天师”",
      "text": "......滚吧滚吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "绩",
      "text": "后会有期。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
